---
config:
  theme: base
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: 16px
    actorBkg: "#EDF2F7"
    actorBorder: "#879AB0"
    actorTextColor: "#25364A"
    signalColor: "#475467"
    noteBkgColor: "#F7F1E5"
    noteBorderColor: "#B3A078"
  sequence:
    mirrorActors: true
    useMaxWidth: false
    actorMargin: 30
    messageMargin: 24
---
sequenceDiagram
  actor Human as Human / browser
  box Existing OCC API process
    participant API as HTTP / Audit
    participant Authority as Authentication / IAM
    participant State as Original State
  end
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  Note over Human,DB: 1. Proposed admission: actual human and exact Installation grant
  Human->>API: GET /audit-events with session and bounded query or cursor
  API->>Authority: Recognize actual request and current human Principal
  Authority-->>API: Genuine account, method and session authority or refusal
  API->>State: Bind read intent and server-owned singleton
  State->>DB: BEGIN original-client write transaction
  Note over Authority,DB: 2. Original-owner guard order and currentness after waits
  State->>DB: Installation authority, sorted account/method/session guards
  State->>DB: Selected policy barrier and head
  State->>Authority: Check genuine current account/method/session and exact IAM grant
  Authority-->>State: Current read authority or refusal
  Note over Authority,DB: Every enabled account/credential/logout writer interlocks<br/>Recheck after waits through settlement, including clock-based expiry
  alt Current human, grant and bounded cursor are valid
    Note over API,DB: 3. Bounded query and closed projection
    State->>DB: Positive tuples, fixed window and exact keyset before LIMIT + 1
    DB-->>State: Actual row envelopes with exact timestamp precision
    State->>API: Validate closed events and page, reject malformed supported rows
    API-->>State: Safe bounded page or refusal
    Note over API,DB: 4. Mandatory disclosure for empty and nonempty pages
    State->>Authority: Reauthorize current account/method/session and selected IAM
    Authority-->>State: Current authority or refusal
    State->>DB: Append safe disclosure on the same client
    State->>DB: COMMIT under mandatory through-settlement currentness
    alt Acknowledged COMMIT and currentness contract holds
      DB-->>State: COMMIT acknowledged
      State-->>API: Authorized page and bounded continuation
      API-->>Human: Cache-Control no-store page
    else Append failed or caught, authority lost, rollback or COMMIT unknown
      DB-->>State: Failure, rollback or unknown settlement
      State-->>API: No page or cursor
      API-->>Human: Sanitized refusal, no protected bytes
      Note over State,DB: Uncertain disclosure may persist, but proves no browser receipt<br/>A retry cannot relabel the earlier outcome
    end
  else Admission, permission, cursor or dependency fails
    State-->>API: No page, preserve mandatory safe denial
    API-->>Human: Sanitized refusal, no protected bytes
  end
  Note over Human,DB: 5. Independent refresh repeats authorization<br/>Late/backdated rows may appear, prior uncertainty remains unknown
  Human->>API: New independently authorized request if still permitted
